sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as Platform Orchestrator<br/>(rhods-operator)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as Workbenches Controller
    participant FS as Filesystem<br/>/opt/manifests
    participant HWWebhook as Hardware Profile<br/>Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ConnWebhook as Connection<br/>Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Orchestrator,Controller: Flow 1: Workbenches Reconciliation

    Orchestrator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Workbenches CR<br/>+ odh-workbenches-config ConfigMap
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (Workbenches CR)<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token
    Controller->>FS: Read kustomize manifests<br/>(kf-notebook-controller,<br/>odh-notebook-controller,<br/>notebooks)
    FS-->>Controller: Raw manifests
    Controller->>Controller: Copy to tempdir, inject params<br/>(gateway-url, mlflow-enabled,<br/>section-title, namespace)
    Controller->>Controller: kustomize build
    Controller->>K8sAPI: SSA Patch (ForceOwnership)<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Applied resources
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Read ConfigMap<br/>(distribution identity + version)<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: ConfigMap data
    Controller->>K8sAPI: List Deployments<br/>(check readiness)<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Deployment status
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Workbenches status<br/>(phase, conditions, distribution)<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token

    Note over K8sAPI,HWWebhook: Flow 2: Hardware Profile Webhook

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        K8sAPI->>HWWebhook: POST /workbenches-hardware-profile<br/>Notebook create/update<br/>HTTPS/9443, API server client cert
        HWWebhook->>K8sAPI: GET HardwareProfile CR<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token
        K8sAPI-->>HWWebhook: HardwareProfile spec<br/>(resources, nodeSelector, tolerations)
        HWWebhook->>HWWebhook: Inject/merge/replace<br/>resource requirements,<br/>nodeSelector, tolerations
        HWWebhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response<br/>(mutated Notebook)
    end

    Note over K8sAPI,ConnWebhook: Flow 3: Connection Secret Webhook

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        K8sAPI->>ConnWebhook: POST /workbenches-connection-notebook<br/>Notebook create/update<br/>HTTPS/9443, API server client cert
        ConnWebhook->>K8sAPI: GET Secret (validate existence)<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token
        K8sAPI-->>ConnWebhook: Secret exists
        ConnWebhook->>K8sAPI: Create SubjectAccessReview<br/>(check user can GET secret)<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token
        K8sAPI-->>ConnWebhook: Allowed / Denied
        ConnWebhook->>ConnWebhook: Inject envFrom secretRef<br/>entries into first container
        ConnWebhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response<br/>(mutated Notebook)
    end
